flowchart LR
  P[00 · Prepare\nPractice system] --> O[01 · Orient\nAutomation opportunity]
  O --> C[02 · Connect\nAPIs, webhooks, data]
  C --> B[03 · Orchestrate\nFirst n8n system]
  B --> S[04 · Shape\nSafe data contracts]
  S --> A[05 · Augment\nBounded AI step]
  A --> R[06 · Operate\nReliability and runbooks]
  R --> G[07 · Agents\nContext, tools, evaluation]
  G --> K[08 · Capstone\nDeploy and prove value]

  O -. choose a real problem .-> P
  S -. validate before automation .-> C
  R -. harden before autonomy .-> A
  K -. document the evidence .-> R

